[b]Dear Holy Heroes,[/b]

Here is the latest update with improvements:
•	Reduced the MP amount for some monsters;
•	Increased initial gold from 150-250 to 250-500;
•	Temporal bosses will have immunity to Dominion and Petrification;
•	Automatic detection of resolutions higher than 1920x1080p, while maintaining a 16:9 aspect ratio for full-screen modeAdded;
•	Two new essential items that provide immunity to sleep and paralysis;
•	Adjustments to the text formatting of numerical values for damage and benefits: font size changed from 15 to 16, made bold, and moved slightly outward. The colors remain unchanged because there are 11 different damage sources, each correlated to a sphere of power, so the shades cannot be altered to maintain these correlations within the game.
•	Adjustment of difficulty modes, making all mechanics available at all levels, with various point adjustments as illustrated in the table below. Previously, special chests were more available to those who took greater risks (Nightmare mode), but it was decided to make them more accessible for those who want a lighter start in the game. Finally, the increase in initial gold will also help adventurers when starting out, ensuring compatibility between solo and group play styles.

We are always open to feedback, suggestions, and any other topics related to Holy Heroes!

We love this game and will do everything to ensure you have a great experience!

